-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- a unit at its parameters
-- what a reading is a function of besides the unit: the Target; the layouts (the unit's); the
-- order of evaluation where the standard leaves it unspecified (cxu-ltr: the operands of an
-- operator with no sequencing rule, the arguments of a call among themselves: left to right,
-- or right to left); when a parameter's lifetime ends ([expr.call]/6: implementation-defined:
-- cxu-parm-full true: at the end of the enclosing full-expression; false: when the function
-- returns); the fuel of each loop and the fuel of calls (their nesting depth).
record CxU = { cxu-t : Target ; cxu-ds : List CDecl ; cxu-lay : LayEnv ; cxu-ltr : Bool
             ; cxu-parm-full : Bool ; cxu-loop-fuel : Word ; cxu-call-fuel : Word }
